              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cake_monsta"
            },
            "reviewBody": "that was good! i used vanilla instead of amaretto, but it was just fine! i left it in the freezer overnight and that worked! Tho very chocolaty. Next time i will use milk instead of water. then i t will be ICE CREAM!!!!YUM!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-15T13:38:25.530Z"
          },
