              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MJ Simmons"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was okay as is for my adult tastes. However, since I made it for my dairy-allergic son, the amaretto just didn't work. I will try it again but with vanilla extract next time.",
            "datePublished": "2010-07-18T17:09:42.170Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
